    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my 3 year old has had a really bad stomach bug since yesterday. he's barely been peeing and his mouth looks super dry. i'm worried he's dehydrated but i don't want to take him to the ER in the middle of the night if i can help it. can i just give him some salt tablets or something to help him hold onto water?",
