      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get that, but pedialyte is so expensive and i only have some old salt tablets from my own kit here. i read online that salt helps you keep water in. if i just crushed up like a tiny bit of a tablet in a big bottle of water, wouldn't that basically just be like making a homemade electrolyte drink? it seems like a much faster way to fix him than just sipping plain water if he's already looking pretty bad.",
